        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DP2576, Traditional Solid Brass 8 Inch C Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional style pull is cast in solid brass and finished in your choice of 5 different finish colors. Manufactured by Deltana, the 8\" Decorative Door Pull With Rosettes has a 1\" diameter with a 3\" projection. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DP2576-Specifications.gif?v=1704354634\" width=\"594\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" atl=\"8 Inch C-Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer <a href=\"/products/10-inch-decorative-door-pull-with-rosettes-deltana-dp2578\"><b>10 Inch Decorative Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana DP2576 Traditional 8 Inch Pull With Rosettes:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 8\" </li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Screws: 1/4\"-24 x 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with thru-bolt mounting screws and 2 matching finish rosettes. The rosettes add the extra dimensional layer for a high end finished door pull appearance. You can also use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-decorative-screw-cover-deltana-scd100\"><b>Decorative Screw Covers</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/sleek-screw-cover-deltana-scf100\"><b>Flat Top Screw Covers</b></a> to hide the screw heads on the inside of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
