                "description": "Traditional 8 Inch C Pull Deltana DP2576 - This traditional style pull is cast in solid brass and finished in your choice of 5 different finish colors. Manufactured by Deltana, the 8 inch Decorative Door Pull With Rosettes has a 1 inch diameter with a 3 inch projection. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware.",
